[ Screaming Continues ]

709
00:51:00.265 --> 00:51:02.474
No!
[ Screams ]

710
00:51:03.977 --> 00:51:07.980
Let's backtrack
and get as far away from here
as possible.

711
00:51:08.064 --> 00:51:09.940
He's not gonna stop
until we're all dead.

712
00:51:10.066 --> 00:51:12.734
Who the fuck is he?
Tell me right now!
[ Gasps ] I don't know!

713
00:51:12.819 --> 00:51:15.487
The fuckyou don't!
You grew up here!
The sheriffsaid so!

714
00:51:16.656 --> 00:51:18.782
[ Grunts ]

715
00:51:18.866 --> 00:51:22.411
Now you better get us
the fuck out of here
before that freak comes back.

716
00:51:22.495 --> 00:51:24.121
Fuck him.
We don't need him anymore.

717
00:51:24.205 --> 00:51:26.707
You kill me,
and you're on your own— lost.

718
00:51:26.791 --> 00:51:30.711
- Maybe I don't give a shit.
- He doesn't know anything!
Can't you see that?

719
00:51:30.795 --> 00:51:34.047
Whoa! Just wait a minute.
Ifyou kill him now, we are fucked.

720
00:51:34.132 --> 00:51:36.466
Okay? We have no idea
where we're going,

721
00:51:36.551 --> 00:51:40.387
with some crazy hick
out there trying to pick us
all offone by one.

722
00:51:44.225 --> 00:51:47.185
No.

723
00:51:47.270 --> 00:51:49.521
[ Chavez ]
Enough. Come on.

724
00:51:50.690 --> 00:51:53.275
Now, you don't want
to see me angry.

725
00:51:53.359 --> 00:51:57.821
Now, you get me to that station—
and a phone, you hear?

726
00:52:00.908 --> 00:52:02.993
[ Screaming ]
No!

727
00:52:03.077 --> 00:52:08.540
[ Screaming ]
Stop! Stop! Stop!
Stop! Stop! God!

728
00:52:24.682 --> 00:52:26.892
I need a rest.

729
00:52:26.976 --> 00:52:30.062
Get the fuck up.
We gotta keep moving.

730
00:52:31.898 --> 00:52:34.691
Get up, both ofyou.

731
00:52:34.817 --> 00:52:38.028
- It's the money that's slowing us down.
We gotta lose it.
- No way.

732
00:52:38.112 --> 00:52:40.280
They'll be looking for us
in a couple of hours.

733
00:52:40.365 --> 00:52:43.325
Ifwe don't show up at Hazelton,
the F.B.I., U.S. Marshals...

734
00:52:43.409 --> 00:52:45.994
and every law officer in West Virginia
is gonna be hunting you.

735
00:52:46.079 --> 00:52:49.206
Brandon's right.
Ifyou want to get away,
you need to move quicker.

736
00:52:49.290 --> 00:52:51.792
- Dump the money.
- Now you listen to me.

737
00:52:51.876 --> 00:52:56.588
We move now with the cash,
or we all wait here and die.

738
00:52:56.673 --> 00:52:58.840
[ Bag Drops On Ground ]
[ Floyd ] She's the one
who's slowin' us down.

739
00:52:58.925 --> 00:53:00.384
[ Gasps ]
Ah.

740
00:53:00.468 --> 00:53:02.928
- [ Chavez ] Be cool.
- [ Sniffs ]

741
00:53:04.097 --> 00:53:05.889
Be cool.

742
00:53:05.973 --> 00:53:08.558
She's a nice piece ofass though.

743
00:53:08.643 --> 00:53:12.396
Let'sjust pass her around,
then pop her in the head...

744
00:53:12.480 --> 00:53:14.898
and get the fuck out of-

745
00:53:15.733 --> 00:53:17.901
[ Grunting ]

746
00:53:17.985 --> 00:53:20.320
[ Groans ]

747
00:53:20.446 --> 00:53:22.572
I'm gonna kill you,
you fuckin' bitch!
[ Shotgun Cocks ]

748
00:53:22.699 --> 00:53:25.742
[ Panting ]
Notjust yet.

749
00:53:27.787 --> 00:53:29.705
Now be cool.
Stay calm.

750
00:53:29.789 --> 00:53:32.624
I got this in hand.

751
00:53:33.960 --> 00:53:35.836
Be cool. All right?

752
00:53:37.338 --> 00:53:40.006
Now, you just chill
the fuck out.

753
00:53:40.091 --> 00:53:43.385
- You're dead, bitch.
- We're all dead, asshole!

754
00:53:43.469 --> 00:53:46.763
Give me my gun back.
[ Panting ]

755
00:53:46.848 --> 00:53:50.225
Looks like you got some
impulse-control issues there, Floyd.

756
00:53:50.309 --> 00:53:51.977
I don't think so.

757
00:53:52.061 --> 00:53:55.272
You having all three guns
does us no good ifthat freak
comes after us again.

758
00:53:57.024 --> 00:54:00.110
Then that'sjust a chance
I'm gonna have to take.

759
00:54:02.697 --> 00:54:06.032
They're gonna start lookin' for us soon.
There'll be a full search by morning.

760
00:54:06.117 --> 00:54:08.452
- Ifwe make it till then.
- We'll make it.

761
00:54:08.536 --> 00:54:11.163
These guys don't look like
they'rejust gonna let you go.

762
00:54:13.791 --> 00:54:16.877
Why haven't they
killed you already?

763
00:54:17.003 --> 00:54:19.755
They need me.
And what happens when
they don't need you anymore?

764
00:54:19.839 --> 00:54:23.091
I'm not planning on finding out.
There should be a radio
and cell phone at the watchtower.

765
00:54:23.176 --> 00:54:24.885
I'll call for help once we get there.

766
00:54:24.969 --> 00:54:27.846
- How do you plan on keeping
this lot under control?
- There's a ladder.

767
00:54:27.930 --> 00:54:29.931
Only one person can climb up at a time.

768
00:54:30.016 --> 00:54:33.101
It's 75 feet straight up
and through a trapdoor.

769
00:54:33.186 --> 00:54:35.937
Each station has a gun hidden in it,
and I know where they keep it.

770
00:54:36.022 --> 00:54:38.482
It's a tight space.
I can ambush Chavez
when we're up there.

771
00:54:39.984 --> 00:54:41.568
I just want to go home.

772
00:54:44.781 --> 00:54:48.033
It'll be okay, Alex.
I'll get you out ofthis.

773
00:55:06.552 --> 00:55:10.222
[ Faint Shrieking ]

774
00:55:23.611 --> 00:55:25.612
[ Chavez ]
Walkin' a little slow
there, aren't you, Floyd?

775
00:55:25.696 --> 00:55:27.823
She hurt you that bad?

776
00:55:30.159 --> 00:55:31.952
- Die, bitch!
- Wha—

777
00:55:32.036 --> 00:55:34.579
[ Both Grunting ]

778
00:55:34.664 --> 00:55:35.956
Come on.

779
00:55:39.001 --> 00:55:41.378
[ Grunting Continues ]

780
00:55:52.515 --> 00:55:54.099
[ Yells ]

781
00:55:58.354 --> 00:56:01.439
SheriffCarver calling Deputy Lane.
Come in. Over.

782
00:56:01.524 --> 00:56:04.359
Ally, this is Calvin.
Come in. Over.
[ Radio Static ]

783
00:56:04.443 --> 00:56:06.820
County Dispatch,
this is SheriffCarver.

784
00:56:06.946 --> 00:56:09.865
I want to report an emergency. Over.
[ Man On Radio ]
Go, Sheriff.

785
00:56:09.949 --> 00:56:12.450
The custody bus from
Grafton Penitentiary has crashed...

786
00:56:12.535 --> 00:56:15.245
offthe old mill road
near mile marker 37.

787
00:56:15.329 --> 00:56:18.623
I'm goin' in to take a look around.
Carver out.

788
00:56:27.300 --> 00:56:29.593
Dispatch, this is Carver.
[ Man On Radio ]
Come in, Sheriff.

789
00:56:29.677 --> 00:56:33.054
[ Sheriff]
There is no one onboard.
Gonna see if I can track them.

790
00:56:33.139 --> 00:56:35.849
Carver out.
Roger that.

791
00:56:39.020 --> 00:56:40.145
[ Grunts ]

792
00:56:41.981 --> 00:56:44.733
Come on. Let's go.

793
00:56:44.817 --> 00:56:47.652
[ Both Grunting ]

794
00:57:05.046 --> 00:57:06.171
[ Fist Smacks ]

795
00:57:13.304 --> 00:57:15.388
All right. Stop.
He's had enough.

796
00:57:15.473 --> 00:57:18.516
- I say when
the Nazi bastard's had enough!
- [ Floyd Groaning ]

797
00:57:19.268 --> 00:57:20.435
[ Grunts ]
[ Groans ]

798
00:57:20.519 --> 00:57:22.520
[ Spits ]

799
00:57:22.647 --> 00:57:25.607
Now, which way did they go?
I don't know.

800
00:57:25.691 --> 00:57:27.651
I didn't see 'em go.

801
00:57:27.735 --> 00:57:29.319
Come on.

802
00:57:29.403 --> 00:57:32.530
Well, what do we do with him?

803
00:57:32.615 --> 00:57:35.325
Fuck him. Leave him.

804
00:57:37.995 --> 00:57:40.038
Nate, I—

805
00:57:40.122 --> 00:57:42.749
I can't run anymore.

806
00:57:42.833 --> 00:57:45.502
I— I just need a minute.

807
00:57:45.586 --> 00:57:47.587
We need to keep moving.

808
00:57:49.131 --> 00:57:51.758
Wejust have to make it
a few more hours,
and then we'll be fine.

809
00:57:51.842 --> 00:57:54.386
The police are coming.
You can do this.

810
00:57:59.225 --> 00:58:01.476
Listen, Chavez.

811
00:58:01.560 --> 00:58:03.770
You can't get
out of here alone.

812
00:58:03.896 --> 00:58:07.232
You know that, right?
I'll be fine.

813
00:58:07.316 --> 00:58:10.652
- Well, I can get you
out ofthese woods.
- So, what do you want?

814
00:58:10.736 --> 00:58:11.861
A fair deal.

815
00:58:13.447 --> 00:58:15.991
- How much?
- [ Scoffs ]
No.

816
00:58:16.075 --> 00:58:18.284
I don't want the money.
I don't need it.

817
00:58:18.369 --> 00:58:20.996
But you gotta promise me
that you'll let me go
when your boys show up.

818
00:58:21.080 --> 00:58:22.288
Fine.

819
00:58:23.958 --> 00:58:26.334
And, uh, I also need
one ofthose guns.

820
00:58:26.419 --> 00:58:28.253
Why should I give you a gun?

821
00:58:28.337 --> 00:58:32.340
Because whatever's hunting us
is gonna continue hunting us
till we're both dead.

822
00:58:32.425 --> 00:58:35.385
It's simple tactical strategy.
Two gunners are better than one.

823
00:58:36.512 --> 00:58:38.972
- And why should I trust you?
- [ Scoffs ]

824
00:58:39.056 --> 00:58:40.974
Why would I fuckyou?

825
00:58:42.059 --> 00:58:43.977
I helped you
with Floyd, didn't I?

826
00:58:44.061 --> 00:58:46.771
Well, I didn't run.

827
00:58:54.655 --> 00:58:57.323
[ Groaning ]

828
00:58:58.993 --> 00:59:01.077
[ Spits, Panting ]

829
00:59:01.162 --> 00:59:03.121
[ Grunting ]

830
00:59:18.846 --> 00:59:20.805
[ Chittering ]

831
00:59:22.641 --> 00:59:24.726
[ Door Creaks ]
[ Lock Clicks ]

832
00:59:24.810 --> 00:59:27.479
[ Muttering ]
[ Chittering Continues ]

833
00:59:30.316 --> 00:59:37.947
[ Muttering Continues ]

834
00:59:38.991 --> 00:59:40.325
Ah.

835
00:59:42.995 --> 00:59:45.497
[ Muttering ]

836
00:59:48.000 --> 00:59:50.543
[ Engine Starts ]
[ Groans ]

837
00:59:56.175 --> 00:59:58.468
[ Barking ]

838
01:00:06.477 --> 01:00:08.978
[ Distant Whistle ]

839
01:00:10.022 --> 01:00:12.190
[ Distant Chittering ]

840
01:00:15.152 --> 01:00:18.113
[ Inhales, Exhales ]

841
01:00:18.197 --> 01:00:20.907
Where will you take them,
Nate?

842
01:00:21.909 --> 01:00:23.952
[ Breathing Heavily ]

843
01:00:24.036 --> 01:00:26.371
I'm too old for this shit.

844
01:00:37.591 --> 01:00:39.300
Come on.

845
01:00:39.385 --> 01:00:43.179
We gotta go.
We're not far now.

846
01:00:46.725 --> 01:00:48.726
Psst!
[ Nate ]
We gotta move.

847
01:00:48.811 --> 01:00:50.728
We gotta keep moving.

848
01:00:50.813 --> 01:00:53.439
[ Alex ]
I can't go on anymore.
[ Nate ] Come on.

849
01:00:53.524 --> 01:00:55.525
[ Whispers ]
Over there.

850
01:00:57.653 --> 01:01:01.489
Okay. Let's leave
the bags down over here.
Come on.

851
01:01:04.118 --> 01:01:06.119
We'll come back for them later.

852
01:01:09.748 --> 01:01:12.292
- [ Screams ]
- [ Grunting ]

853
01:01:12.376 --> 01:01:14.711
[ Blow Lands ]
[ Screams ]

854
01:01:14.795 --> 01:01:16.504
You shouldn't have run.

855
01:01:16.589 --> 01:01:18.464
Stop it! Stop it!

856
01:01:18.591 --> 01:01:21.885
[ Grunts, Sobs ]
Shut the fuck up, puta!

857
01:01:21.969 --> 01:01:23.636
This is all your fault!

858
01:01:23.721 --> 01:01:26.306
- Maybe I should end you first!
- Wait. That's not gonna get us anywhere.

859
01:01:26.390 --> 01:01:28.057
It gets the bitch
out ofthe way though!

860
01:01:28.142 --> 01:01:31.436
The watchtower'sjust right over the hill.
[ Grunts ]

861
01:01:31.520 --> 01:01:34.397
You've been leading us
in circles all night.

862
01:01:34.481 --> 01:01:36.482
Why should I believe you now?

863
01:01:36.567 --> 01:01:40.445
It'sjust over the hill—
right there. I swear.

864
01:01:40.529 --> 01:01:44.616
It'll take two minutes
to find out. Please.
Get this bitch out!

865
01:01:47.453 --> 01:01:49.454
[ Grunting ]

866
01:01:50.831 --> 01:01:52.749
Move.

867
01:01:52.833 --> 01:01:54.792
[ Whimpers ]

868
01:02:15.981 --> 01:02:21.110
[ Chavez ]
This is it?
A bunch offuckin' charcoal?

869
01:02:21.195 --> 01:02:24.030
- It must've been burned down.
- No shit.

870
01:02:24.114 --> 01:02:26.032
So now what?

871
01:02:26.116 --> 01:02:29.369
I don't know.
This is the only place
I knew ofthat had a radio.

872
01:02:30.955 --> 01:02:33.414
You've been fuckin' with me
the whole time, haven't you?

873
01:02:33.499 --> 01:02:36.251
- No.
- Fuck you. You're a liar!

874
01:02:36.335 --> 01:02:39.087
He's not lying.
Nate thought the tower
was gonna be here.

875
01:02:39.171 --> 01:02:42.257
We were gonna barricade
ourselves in and call for help.

876
01:02:42.341 --> 01:02:46.511
Well, let'sjust keep moving,
all right? It's gotta be at least
3:00 or 4:00 a.m. by now.

877
01:02:46.595 --> 01:02:49.430
- We could go northeast.
- I've had enough ofyour bullshit.

878
01:02:49.515 --> 01:02:52.141
Get on your fuckin' knees!

879
01:02:52.226 --> 01:02:55.395
- Get on your fuckin' knees!
- There's a small town
1 0 miles past the river.

880
01:02:55.479 --> 01:02:58.773
- I'll take you there.
- Fuckyou. Say good-bye, asshole.

881
01:02:58.857 --> 01:03:00.900
- Think about this, Chavez.
- He's out there.

882
01:03:00.985 --> 01:03:02.485
What?

883
01:03:04.071 --> 01:03:06.239
I can feel him.

884
01:03:06.323 --> 01:03:09.367
He's been following us.
He's close.

885
01:03:10.369 --> 01:03:12.328
Shh.

886
01:03:16.834 --> 01:03:18.710
[ Chuckles ]

887
01:03:18.794 --> 01:03:20.712
[ Gun Cocks ]
I warned you.

888
01:03:20.796 --> 01:03:24.173
- [ Growling ]
- [ Chavez Screaming ]

889
01:03:26.051 --> 01:03:28.678
Get it off me!
Get this fucking dog off me!

890
01:03:28.762 --> 01:03:31.097
Drop the gun!
Down, boy!

891
01:03:31.223 --> 01:03:33.516
Get the dog off me!
Take his guns, Nate.

892
01:03:40.524 --> 01:03:42.483
Are you okay?

893
01:03:42.568 --> 01:03:45.528
I'm fine, Sheriff.
Just really glad to see you.

894
01:03:45.612 --> 01:03:48.448
When you didn't answer
your cell, I— I came looking.

895
01:03:48.574 --> 01:03:51.326
There are others out there.
How many?

896
01:03:51.410 --> 01:03:55.371
Don't know.
At least one other prisoner
and some freak hillbilly local.

897
01:03:55.456 --> 01:03:58.916
Hillbilly? That can't be.

898
01:03:59.001 --> 01:04:02.545
Please. Let'sjust get out of here.

899
01:04:02.629 --> 01:04:07.133
Okay. Come on.
Let's move it up there.

900
01:04:07.217 --> 01:04:10.887
Hey, you, come on.
Move your ass. Get up.

901
01:04:10.971 --> 01:04:12.680
Come on! Move it!

902
01:04:12.765 --> 01:04:15.641
Move it, you son ofa bitch!
Move!

903
01:04:17.019 --> 01:04:19.020
Come on, honey.

904
01:04:20.606 --> 01:04:23.524
He's close.
He's really close.

905
01:04:23.650 --> 01:04:27.362
Who is?
He's a fucking monster.

906
01:04:27.446 --> 01:04:30.365
Please. Please.
I just want to get home.

907
01:04:30.449 --> 01:04:34.077
Oh, all right.Just—
Just calm down, little lady.

908
01:04:34.161 --> 01:04:36.079
[ Cackling ]

909
01:04:36.163 --> 01:04:38.122
- [ Screams ]
- [ Screams ]

910
01:04:38.916 --> 01:04:41.084
[ Whimpering ]

911
01:04:41.168 --> 01:04:43.669
- [ Cackling ]
- [ Gunshots ]

912
01:04:43.754 --> 01:04:46.339
Ifyou thinkyou're
moving out ofthis forest...

913
01:04:46.423 --> 01:04:49.175
without going back for the cash,
you're fuckin' wrong.

914
01:04:49.259 --> 01:04:50.968
Now move. Move.

915
01:04:51.053 --> 01:04:53.846
[ Sobbing ]

916
01:04:59.645 --> 01:05:01.562
[ Laughs ]

917
01:05:01.647 --> 01:05:04.357
Jackpot.

918
01:05:04.441 --> 01:05:07.652
Chavez, you stupid
son ofa bitch.

919
01:05:16.537 --> 01:05:19.997
[ Grunting, Panting ]

920
01:05:24.211 --> 01:05:28.464
- [ Police Radio Chatter ]
- This is where the sheriff
reported the bus crash.

921
01:05:28.549 --> 01:05:32.009
On foot in this terrain,
they should be
within this perimeter.

922
01:05:32.094 --> 01:05:35.138
I want it approached
from all sides,
and we'll work our way in.

923
01:05:35.222 --> 01:05:37.140
When is the air support
getting here?

924
01:05:37.224 --> 01:05:39.851
They're in the air.
They should be here
within the hour.

925
01:05:39.935 --> 01:05:43.146
Gentleman,
we have a man out there.

926
01:05:43.230 --> 01:05:46.274
I want all precautions taken.

927
01:05:46.400 --> 01:05:48.484
Let's move.
Yes, sir.

928
01:05:55.701 --> 01:05:59.287
Where's my bags?
Are you sure
this was the spot?

929
01:05:59.371 --> 01:06:03.666
Yes, this was the spot.
Now where's my goddamn
fuckin' money?

930
01:06:03.792 --> 01:06:05.877
Huh?
It's Floyd.

931
01:06:05.961 --> 01:06:08.504
I'm gonna kill
that motherfucker.

932
01:06:08.589 --> 01:06:12.216
No. I'm gonna
skin him alive first,

933
01:06:12.301 --> 01:06:14.093
then I'm gonna
fucking kill him!

934
01:06:14.178 --> 01:06:15.761
Shit!

935
01:06:15.846 --> 01:06:18.139
[ Grunting, Panting ]

936
01:06:27.566 --> 01:06:29.484
- [ Bone Crunches ]
- [ Floyd Screaming ]

937
01:06:29.568 --> 01:06:32.236
You— You stay here
and you guard them.

938
01:06:32.321 --> 01:06:36.240
You hear?
You don't move!
Don't move!

939
01:06:36.325 --> 01:06:38.743
[ Panting ]

940
01:06:38.827 --> 01:06:40.828
That'll teach
that motherfucker!

941
01:06:40.913 --> 01:06:45.583
[ Laughing ]
Who's laughin' now,
you Mexican piece ofshit?

942
01:06:47.211 --> 01:06:50.004
[ Screaming ]

943
01:06:50.088 --> 01:06:52.173
Let me go, Brandon.

944
01:06:53.759 --> 01:06:54.926
